contentText:
Grimes and Elon Musk are just like any pair of exes with lingering disagreements. They just so happen to be hashing them out on a social media platform that one of them owns, and the root of their conflict just so happens to be about controversial technology that the musician&#8217;s former partner has plans to invest billions in.

